# Project rules

## Exception: OPS-REPO-P02 (file layout)

Docker and deployment files are not kept in the repository root but in these
directories:

- `legacy/app/docker/**`
- `legacy/app/docker-compose*.yml`
- `legacy/tools/deploy/**`

Reason: inherited repository structure; the move to the standard layout is
planned separately.

All chapter 8 rules (OPS-*) apply to these paths.
